    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Cycle is a first person Horror game where you venture into a dark forest by bike and on foot. Brave hazardous trails on your bike until the path is blocked. Then, explore abandoned sites on foot while solving puzzles and encountering supernatural creatures. Can you survive the cursed forest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive haunted trails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your Bicycle light as a guide, ride through forest trails filled with roadblocks and Creatures out to get you. Be wary of your surroundings as they can come from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate the eerie Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into long abandoned areas of the forest where mysteries and danger await. Uncover the stories of the people that were once there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Supernatural Creatures of the Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter the twisted, possessed creatures of the cursed forest. Fighting is not an option, so hiding from and avoiding them is the only way to avoid a grisly end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles to move forward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out how to navigate the ruins of the forest sites and decipher mysterious puzzles left behind by the forest\u2019s previous inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious Cycle is a first person Horror game where you venture into a dark forest by bike and on foot. Brave hazardous trails on your bike until the path is blocked. Then, explore abandoned sites on foot while solving puzzles and encountering supernatural creatures. Can you survive the cursed forest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive haunted trails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your Bicycle light as a guide, ride through forest trails filled with roadblocks and Creatures out to get you. Be wary of your surroundings as they can come from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/81e95f0e2a86b3cedaa572da23e9d3cd.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate the eerie Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into long abandoned areas of the forest where mysteries and danger await. Uncover the stories of the people that were once there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/c79e4cccacf115897e99f70e35e9f8fa.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Supernatural Creatures of the Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter the twisted, possessed creatures of the cursed forest. Fighting is not an option, so hiding from and avoiding them is the only way to avoid a grisly end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/f7f28b786165cdb4ca1204f0c9a29448.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles to move forward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out how to navigate the ruins of the forest sites and decipher mysterious puzzles left behind by the forest\u2019s previous inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.poster.avif?t=1755623736\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.webm?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355080/extras/4999554621f322d6fe45c23d75d7a809.mp4?t=1755623736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
